(7003283, 1059083, 129512, '<td valign="top">I wanted to take this shot so badly but it was too cold by me. Top 7 for sure. Great capture!</td>', 'I wanted to take this shot so badly but it was too cold by me. Top 7 for sure. Great capture!', '2013-03-20 00:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003290, 1059269, 129512, '<td valign="top">This is perfect.</td>', 'This is perfect.', '2013-03-20 00:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003325, 1058834, 18505, '<td valign="top">Commenting only.... this is beautiful.  I love the waterdrops.  Good job!</td>', 'Commenting only.... this is beautiful.  I love the waterdrops.  Good job!', '2013-03-20 00:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003347, 1059222, 93565, '<td valign="top">I would''ve liked to have seen depth carried at least as far as the back rounds, and the vignette feels a bit unnatural to me.</td>', 'I would''ve liked to have seen depth carried at least as far as the back rounds, and the vignette feels a bit unnatural to me.', '2013-03-20 01:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003350, 1059131, 114285, '<td valign="top">great pic, but too many distractions~</td>', 'great pic, but too many distractions~', '2013-03-20 01:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003351, 1059300, 93565, '<td valign="top">Bit hard to be sure your trees number 13, but it''s a very nice photo. I wish the snow were more undisturbed in the foreground. Curious to see what peak this is.</td>', 'Bit hard to be sure your trees number 13, but it''s a very nice photo. I wish the snow were more undisturbed in the foreground. Curious to see what peak this is.', '2013-03-20 01:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003352, 1059202, 93565, '<td valign="top">Agreed on the comments posted in our discussion. The end result came out nicely, especially with the OOF bright background backlighting the subject. Nicely seen.</td>', 'Agreed on the comments posted in our discussion. The end result came out nicely, especially with the OOF bright background backlighting the subject. Nicely seen.', '2013-03-20 01:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003354, 1058803, 93565, '<td valign="top">Wow- excellently seen. I''m curious if you captured and then thought, hey, maybe there were 13... or if you set out for this. Either way, a great application of the challenge and should be a great placement.</td>', 'Wow- excellently seen. I''m curious if you captured and then thought, hey, maybe there were 13... or if you set out for this. Either way, a great application of the challenge and should be a great placement.', '2013-03-20 01:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003356, 1058795, 93565, '<td valign="top">Extremely clean stock type photo. Arrangement is good but also looks unnatural, as well. It''s nice to see a stock shot that isn''t 13 of the same thing lined up together in an uninteresting fashion, however.</td>', 'Extremely clean stock type photo. Arrangement is good but also looks unnatural, as well. It''s nice to see a stock shot that isn''t 13 of the same thing lined up together in an uninteresting fashion, however.', '2013-03-20 01:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003358, 1059206, 93565, '<td valign="top">So I take it to mean that 1 is evidently too many?<br/> <br/>Well lit, nicely executed, but the idea isn''t fleshed out entirely so far as the suggestion of the title goes. Still, this is extremely clean and catalogue worthy.</td>', 'So I take it to mean that 1 is evidently too many? Well lit, nicely executed, but the idea isn''t fleshed out entirely so far as the suggestion of the title goes. Still, this is extremely clean and catalogue worthy.', '2013-03-20 01:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003361, 1059349, 93565, '<td valign="top">Hmm. Very cool. I wish the writing in the background were absent, but this is a pretty interesting shot.</td>', 'Hmm. Very cool. I wish the writing in the background were absent, but this is a pretty interesting shot.', '2013-03-20 01:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003364, 1059193, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''ve been generally unimpressed with all the entries that are 13 of whatever arbitrary item, as they''re boring and uninteresting, but this is cool. You''ve made it cool through the limited DoF, the muted tones, and the interesting texture.</td>', 'I''ve been generally unimpressed with all the entries that are 13 of whatever arbitrary item, as they''re boring and uninteresting, but this is cool. You''ve made it cool through the limited DoF, the muted tones, and the interesting texture.', '2013-03-20 01:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003366, 1059361, 93565, '<td valign="top">Editing is a bit weird here. The left has obviously been muted, be it burning or by a selection and dropping curves/levels. It looks very unnatural, and this is magnified by the differing levels of detail on the flower.</td>', 'Editing is a bit weird here. The left has obviously been muted, be it burning or by a selection and dropping curves/levels. It looks very unnatural, and this is magnified by the differing levels of detail on the flower.', '2013-03-20 01:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003369, 1059366, 93565, '<td valign="top">This gave me a laugh so soon as I brought it up. 13 of a random object is easy and uninteresting, but to tell SOME story with 13 whatevers is what gets my vote, and you have done that quite well. Nice lighting, I particularly enjoy the shadows of the "crowd" upon the dejected pear. Nicely done.</td>', 'This gave me a laugh so soon as I brought it up. 13 of a random object is easy and uninteresting, but to tell SOME story with 13 whatevers is what gets my vote, and you have done that quite well. Nice lighting, I particularly enjoy the shadows of the "crowd" upon the dejected pear. Nicely done.', '2013-03-20 01:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003379, 1058813, 93565, '<td valign="top">13 stripes flying illegally, according to flag code ;0<br/> <br/>But I''m not insanely patriotic, so no worries. :)<br/> <br/>Your editing does seem a bit heavy handed in order to make the reds look super red and the whites the same. The tatters also look a bit...odd, like they''ve been selected a bit quickly. Their edges seem too definite and hard.</td>', '13 stripes flying illegally, according to flag code ;0 But I''m not insanely patriotic, so no worries. :) Your editing does seem a bit heavy handed in order to make the reds look super red and the whites the same. The tatters also look a bit...odd, like they''ve been selected a bit quickly. Their edges seem too definite and hard.', '2013-03-20 02:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003383, 1058896, 93565, '<td valign="top">Let''s just hope it''s not Smirnoff ice or BL ;0<br/> <br/>Interesting Kirk Kobayashi Maru on the challenge.</td>', 'Let''s just hope it''s not Smirnoff ice or BL ;0 Interesting Kirk Kobayashi Maru on the challenge.', '2013-03-20 02:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
