(7005386, 1059419, 124982, '<td valign="top">Really simply and elegantly done. Who knew nuts could be so photogenic! A little overexposed with hotspots on the top of the nuts, but otherwise nicely done!</td>', 'Really simply and elegantly done. Who knew nuts could be so photogenic! A little overexposed with hotspots on the top of the nuts, but otherwise nicely done!', '2013-03-23 10:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005387, 1058874, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and idea! The white balance (or something else) seems to be a little off as the colors don''t seem to be accurate. Almost like you''ve applied bleach effect -- all the colors are washed out and unnatural?</td>', 'Nice composition and idea! The white balance (or something else) seems to be a little off as the colors don''t seem to be accurate. Almost like you''ve applied bleach effect -- all the colors are washed out and unnatural?', '2013-03-23 10:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005388, 1059190, 124982, '<td valign="top">Aside from the hotspot from the flash, I like this composition! A little more light and detail in the books would''ve been nice since books always have such lovely character in the covers and pages.</td>', 'Aside from the hotspot from the flash, I like this composition! A little more light and detail in the books would''ve been nice since books always have such lovely character in the covers and pages.', '2013-03-23 10:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005389, 1058710, 124982, '<td valign="top">A somewhat mundane every-day subject like pins can work, provided the lighting and composition are spot on. I think you fell a little short on that, which makes stimulating interest in the voter quite challenging.</td>', 'A somewhat mundane every-day subject like pins can work, provided the lighting and composition are spot on. I think you fell a little short on that, which makes stimulating interest in the voter quite challenging.', '2013-03-23 10:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005390, 1058795, 124982, '<td valign="top">Most attractive. Quite a barrage of color and textures. Quite beautifully done! Would''ve made for a great Sherpet entry too!</td>', 'Most attractive. Quite a barrage of color and textures. Quite beautifully done! Would''ve made for a great Sherpet entry too!', '2013-03-23 10:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005391, 1059418, 124982, '<td valign="top">What a lovely, off-the-wall kind of composition! Took me a while to find the hidden hummingbird (right hand side of the top left feeder) since it was overlapped with the one in front of it. Hope the other voters aren''t voting you down cause of it. That aside I love the composition, I think the lighting is a little strong/overexposed since the gorgeous colors of the birds are touch washed out.</td>', 'What a lovely, off-the-wall kind of composition! Took me a while to find the hidden hummingbird (right hand side of the top left feeder) since it was overlapped with the one in front of it. Hope the other voters aren''t voting you down cause of it. That aside I love the composition, I think the lighting is a little strong/overexposed since the gorgeous colors of the birds are touch washed out.', '2013-03-23 10:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005392, 1058992, 124982, '<td valign="top">How simple can you get -- clothes pegs. But what a great image -- very thought provoking, made me stay on it for a while and look at all the little details. Very nicely done, I''m a fan!</td>', 'How simple can you get -- clothes pegs. But what a great image -- very thought provoking, made me stay on it for a while and look at all the little details. Very nicely done, I''m a fan!', '2013-03-23 10:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005393, 1059330, 124982, '<td valign="top">Composition, clarity, lighting, sharpness and detail all work. Lovely studio shot! Just not a fan of the purple. For some reason, it seems to detract from the piece. I''d prefer the pearls stand out on their own rather than disappear into uniform purple. Still, a 7 from me.</td>', 'Composition, clarity, lighting, sharpness and detail all work. Lovely studio shot! Just not a fan of the purple. For some reason, it seems to detract from the piece. I''d prefer the pearls stand out on their own rather than disappear into uniform purple. Still, a 7 from me.', '2013-03-23 10:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005394, 1059202, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely background and composition! A little extra light on the flowers would''ve given this so much more punch, since they seem a little underexposed.</td>', 'Lovely background and composition! A little extra light on the flowers would''ve given this so much more punch, since they seem a little underexposed.', '2013-03-23 10:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005395, 1059243, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite magnificent. I''d love to know how you got the blurry reflection...guessing grease on a mirror? Quite lovely colors and composition!</td>', 'Quite magnificent. I''d love to know how you got the blurry reflection...guessing grease on a mirror? Quite lovely colors and composition!', '2013-03-23 10:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005398, 1058839, 124982, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been so much more powerful if the background was different. Right now it competes against, rather than compliments, the gears and wheels. SOmething a little more simple, perhaps? Still, it''s a lovely composition.</td>', 'Would''ve been so much more powerful if the background was different. Right now it competes against, rather than compliments, the gears and wheels. SOmething a little more simple, perhaps? Still, it''s a lovely composition.', '2013-03-23 11:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005400, 1059395, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nicely composted! Lighting seems a little flat though...can''t see any real highlights? Still quite lovely!</td>', 'Nicely composted! Lighting seems a little flat though...can''t see any real highlights? Still quite lovely!', '2013-03-23 11:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005401, 1059343, 124982, '<td valign="top">Never figured out how one plays a 7-string. Tried playing 5-string bass for a while, and just threw me for a loop. Power to you! Back to the image, I really like the composition, the lighting is a touch flat and soft though, so we''re losing some contrast and definition in the axes.</td>', 'Never figured out how one plays a 7-string. Tried playing 5-string bass for a while, and just threw me for a loop. Power to you! Back to the image, I really like the composition, the lighting is a touch flat and soft though, so we''re losing some contrast and definition in the axes.', '2013-03-23 11:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005402, 1058878, 124982, '<td valign="top">Hahaha..at very first glance I thought you were growing flowers in cooking pots!! Took me a few seconds to realize what I was looking at! Not sure the B&amp;W works for this, since when I think of band parade, I think of color and flair and flamboyance!</td>', 'Hahaha..at very first glance I thought you were growing flowers in cooking pots!! Took me a few seconds to realize what I was looking at! Not sure the B&W works for this, since when I think of band parade, I think of color and flair and flamboyance!', '2013-03-23 11:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005403, 1059214, 124982, '<td valign="top">Bizarro composition (in a good way). Not sure about the choice of closed eyes though? I do like the sharpness of the cards and the hand, but would''ve liked a little more definition (focus) on the "queen".</td>', 'Bizarro composition (in a good way). Not sure about the choice of closed eyes though? I do like the sharpness of the cards and the hand, but would''ve liked a little more definition (focus) on the "queen".', '2013-03-23 11:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005406, 1059319, 124982, '<td valign="top">Rather unorthodox composition (not a bad thing!). I''m guessing it''s not doing well with the average voter who wants crystal clear subjects and razor sharp focus? It should do well with the "alternative" crowd though. Love the blur of the ocean and girl and the heavy grain. Give''s it a vintage kind of feel which creates a sense of loneliness to the girl. Nicely done -- really creates an emotional link with the viewer.</td>', 'Rather unorthodox composition (not a bad thing!). I''m guessing it''s not doing well with the average voter who wants crystal clear subjects and razor sharp focus? It should do well with the "alternative" crowd though. Love the blur of the ocean and girl and the heavy grain. Give''s it a vintage kind of feel which creates a sense of loneliness to the girl. Nicely done -- really creates an emotional link with the viewer.', '2013-03-23 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005409, 1058819, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite melody of drama with the water and reflections. The underexposed B&amp;W white treatment adds to it. Image strikes me as Exhibit A in a movie murder scene! Nicely done!</td>', 'Quite melody of drama with the water and reflections. The underexposed B&W white treatment adds to it. Image strikes me as Exhibit A in a movie murder scene! Nicely done!', '2013-03-23 11:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
