(7007494, 1059404, 16148, '<td valign="top">DPC drives us to push sharpness and contrast to the limits.  These images grab your attention but often don''t let us dig deeper.  Your shot, low key or however it''s described, invites us in to explore.  I think a little more light hitting the bottom four flowers would have made this pop.</td>', 'DPC drives us to push sharpness and contrast to the limits.  These images grab your attention but often don''t let us dig deeper.  Your shot, low key or however it''s described, invites us in to explore.  I think a little more light hitting the bottom four flowers would have made this pop.', '2013-03-27 01:47:51.000000', NULL, 0),
