(7011747, 1058328, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this ... vastly under-rated IMHO! If the focus on your subject piece were slightly sharper ... it might have picked up a bit in the voting. If you haven''t tried the OnOne tools ... focus point in this case, you might find them interesting. I have no relationship with the OnOne team but like their stuff!</td>', 'I like this ... vastly under-rated IMHO! If the focus on your subject piece were slightly sharper ... it might have picked up a bit in the voting. If you haven''t tried the OnOne tools ... focus point in this case, you might find them interesting. I have no relationship with the OnOne team but like their stuff!', '2013-04-02 01:53:24.000000', NULL, 0),
